            <h2 class="section-title">Patron ESOP Scheme Design Engagement Tiers</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <p>Engagement scope is set by stage, not by a fixed package. A Nehru Place trading firm issuing its first handful of grants sits in the Seed tier; a Saket consumer-tech venture going into a priced round sits in Pre-Series A or Series A to B; and a Delhi company with NRI promoters or a US/Singapore parent adds the cross-border mirror-grant layer on top. The add-ons below - IBBI valuation, AoA amendment, DPIIT founder ESOP - are priced as pass-throughs or scoped separately so you only pay for what your structure actually needs.</p>
                <div class="table-responsive-wrapper">
                <table>
